%S A401776 1,9,94,305,3420,11623,48542,159070,576107,1842912
%N A401776 Number of free polyiamonds with 3n cells that can be trisected into three congruent polyiamonds.
%C A401776 "Congruent" means equal up to rotation, reflection and translation, so pieces may be mirror images of one another. We call such a polyiamond "trisectable".
